        "original_id": "85fd5b2d-36f3-5321-9e41-3f992c09653e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Richard Baluyut, Fontaine Toups, Edward Baluyut, Patrick Ramos, James Baluyut, Chris Deaner\n- Bands: Monoral, Versus, +/-\n- Companies: Sony Music Japan\n- Places: Japan, New York City\n- Products: You Are Here\n\nFacts:\n- Versus is an American indie rock band that was formed in 1990 in New York City by Richard Baluyut, Fontaine Toups, and Edward Baluyut.\n- Patrick Ramos is a Filipino American musician who was the drummer for the 1990s indie band Versus.\n- Patrick Ramos was also the singer, songwriter, guitarist, and keyboardist for the 2000s indietronic band +/-.\n- You Are Here was the first full-length release to feature the +/- lineup of James Baluyut, Chris Deaner, and Patrick Ramos.\n- Monoral is a Japanese alternative rock band signed to Sony Music Japan.",
